# Vulnerabilities the image scan in CI should not fail on.
#
# CI scans the image with Trivy and fails on fixable HIGH or CRITICAL findings
# (see the "Scan the image" step in .github/workflows/ci.yml). Unfixed findings
# are already skipped. An entry here is a decision: write ABOVE it why the
# finding does not apply or cannot be fixed yet, and when to look at it again.
#
# Example (do not uncomment without a real reason):
#   # Reason: <why>. Revisit: <date>.
#   CVE-0000-00000
